OL,3,GNEWSACounty lines heroin and cocaine
OL,4,Adealer jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father-of-two involved in county
OL,7,Flines drug dealing has been jailed for
OL,8,Ffour and a half years.
OL,10,FSadhiul Haque, 28, of no fixed abode,
OL,11,Fadmitted being concerned in the supply
OL,12,Fof heroin and crack cocaine and being
OL,13,Fin possession of the same drugs with
OL,14,Fintent to supply.
OL,16,FJudge Geoffrey Marson KC told Bradford
OL,17,FCrown Court Haque had been dealing
OL,18,Fsignificant quantities of drugs between
OL,19,FSeptember 2025 and 18 February this
OL,20,Fyear.
